  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Character Creation",
    "section": "2.10",
    "heading": "Choose a Species",
    "lineStart": 958,
    "lineEnd": 962
  },
  "section": "2.10",
  "rulesText": "Choose a species for your character. The following species options are detailed in “Character Origins”: Dragonborn, Dwarf, Elf, Gnome, Goliath, Halfling, Human, Orc, and Tiefling. Once you’ve chosen a species, write it on your character sheet. Then record your species’ traits.\n\nYour character's size and Speed are determined by the character's species; record these in the appropriate places on your character sheet as well (you may write just the first letter of your size)."
}
